<import src="../../templates/state.wxml"/><view class="test-notice">原稿参考配置 · 不自动计价或锁定名额</view><view class="page"><template is="state" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{item}}"><image class="cover" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="imageError"/><view class="h1">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.ageNote}} · {{item.durationNote}}</view><view class="panel"><view class="price">亲子原稿参考价 ¥{{item.referenceParentPrice}} / 组（1大1小）</view><view class="price">单人原稿参考价 ¥{{item.referenceSinglePrice}} / 张</view><view class="muted">单人票对象及优惠待核定；按意向人数申请，费用由人工沟通。</view></view><view class="h2">行程与参加说明</view><view class="intro pre-line">{{item.itinerary}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.code==='01'}}" class="support-note">原稿2小时与导览70分钟＋制作60分钟存在冲突，实际安排待公司核定。</view><view class="panel"><view class="detail-line"><text class="key">包含说明</text><text>{{item.included}}</text></view><view class="detail-line"><text class="key">不含说明</text><text>{{item.excluded}}</text></view><view class="detail-line"><text class="key">作品 / 材料</text><text>{{item.materials}}</text></view><view class="detail-line"><text class="key">集合地点</text><text>{{item.meetingPoint}}</text></view><view class="detail-line"><text class="key">转场安排</text><text>{{item.transfer}}</text></view></view><view class="h2">预约说明</view><view class="intro">{{item.bookingNote}}</view><view class="h2">取消与改期</view><view class="intro">{{item.cancelNote}}</view><view class="sticky-action"><button bindtap="book">提交个人 / 家庭测试申请</button><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="group">团体申请</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="consult">套餐咨询</button></view></view></block></view>
